.TH HOLO 1 "October 2026" "holo 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
holo \- tap your desk, your laptop responds
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B holo
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Holo listens through the laptop's built-in microphone and turns the desk
around the laptop into four tap zones: left rear (lr), left front (lf),
right rear (rr), and right front (rf). Each accepted tap runs the action
assigned to its zone. Calibration and evaluation are guided sessions in the
terminal; the
.B holo.service
systemd user service listens in the background.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B check
Show the microphone route, helper tools, profiles, and service state.
.TP
.B monitor
Live input level and tap classification, without actions.
.TP
.B calibrate
Guided calibration of the four desk zones (ten taps each).
.TP
.B evaluate
Guided 60-tap held-out accuracy test; saves JSON and CSV reports.
.TP
.B report
Show the newest accuracy report.
.TP
.B compare
Compare passive, active, and hybrid sensing on this desk.
.TP
.B actions
List, set, clear, or test zone actions.
.TP
.B profiles
List, select, show, rename, or delete desk profiles.
.TP
.B config
Show or change settings (notifications, default capture device).
.TP
.B run
Listen in the foreground and run actions (what the service runs).
.TP
.BR pause ", " resume ", " status
Control and inspect the background service.
.PP
Every command accepts
.BR \-\-help .
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
holo check
holo calibrate
holo evaluate
holo actions set lr url https://example.com
holo actions set rr shell 'playerctl play-pause'
systemctl \-\-user enable \-\-now holo
journalctl \-\-user \-u holo \-f
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/Holo/
Profiles, accuracy reports, and optional debug recordings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/holo/config.json
Active profile, notification setting, capture settings per profile.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.BR HOLO_DATA_DIR ", " HOLO_CONFIG_DIR ", " HOLO_RUNTIME_DIR
override the data, configuration, and runtime directories.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemctl (1),
.BR journalctl (1),
.BR wpctl (1),
.I /usr/share/doc/holo/README.md
